  "provenance": "Separate source-authored host-hardened semantic qualification campaign. These 54 cases were added after candidate-4 training inputs were fixed, and no candidate-4 weights, cutoff, or original 612-case corpus were changed. The TEST browser shortcut group was independently authored from SF source without access to original held-out inputs or model predictions; one separate author incidentally viewed a limited original browser TEST generator range but did not select these TEST variants. All labels remain machine-authored and require human review. Data 360 raw POST create payloads follow sf-pi references/data-shapes.md for data streams, DLOs, and DMOs; each uses a verified sandbox org, has a distinct split-group endpoint, and omits allow_confirmed while retaining live dry_run=false. The operation-policy rubric labels live durable writes confirm even when the dispatcher permits the request. TEST groups exercise a deprecated Apex CLI alias, a SOQL bulk artifact export, Canvas access changes, and a Lightning Knowledge editor save chord; model predictions were not consulted.",
